## 🛠️ Toolchain Setup

### 🔧 Compilation Steps
1. **Compile Fortran code**:
   ```bash
   gfortran -c kernel.f90
   ```

2. **Compile C stub**:
   ```bash
   gcc -c stub.c
   ```

3. **Link to flat binary**:
   Use a custom linker script to place the binary at a known address:
   ```ld
   ENTRY(main)
   SECTIONS {
       . = 0x1000;
       .text : { *(.text) }
       .data : { *(.data) }
       .bss  : { *(.bss) }
   }
   ```

   Then link:
   ```bash
   ld -T linker.ld -o kernel.bin stub.o kernel.o
   ```

4. **Combine with bootloader**:
   ```bash
   cat bootloader.bin kernel.bin > os.img
   ```

5. **Test with QEMU**:
   ```bash
   qemu-system-x86_64 -drive format=raw,file=os.img
   ```

